OL,3,GNEWSAHouse prices on the rise - how
OL,4,Adoes your area compare?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAffordability continues to be a "real
OL,7,Fchallenge" for some house buyers, after
OL,8,Fprices in Wales rose by 4% in the year
OL,9,Fto June.
OL,11,FThe market has shown "real resilience"
OL,12,Fwith prices more than 7.5 times the
OL,13,Faverage income in some areas, according
OL,14,Fto new figures from the Principality
OL,15,FBuilding Society (PBS).
OL,17,FAnglesey topped the chart with a 22%
OL,18,Fannual rise, but 17 of Wales' 22 local
OL,19,Fauthority areas saw price increases,
OL,20,Fthe Wales House Price Index said.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
