OL,3,GNEWSAHouse prices on the rise - how
OL,4,Adoes your area compare?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCeredigion was one of four regions to
OL,7,Fsee a price drop, and Aberystwyth
OL,8,Festate agent Layla Mangan said she had
OL,9,Fnoticed "a lack of confidence" amongst
OL,10,Fbuyers and sellers who were feeling
OL,11,F"uncertain" about cost of living
OL,12,Fpressures.
